// Title: Amsi.DLL Loaded Via LOLBIN Process
// Rule ID: 6ec86d9e-912e-4726-91a2-209359b999b9
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion
// Category: image_load
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/image_load/image_load_dll_amsi_suspicious_process.yml
